1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,651
GRKN Studios presents.

2
00:00:03,751 --> 00:00:09,162
Stuck in traffic? Here's one jam you'll actually enjoy. Meet Park Pop.

3
00:00:10,062 --> 00:00:16,268
Park Pop is a colourful car parking puzzle. Tap a lane, drive the cars, and park them by colour.

4
00:00:17,068 --> 00:00:22,950
There are no timers, and no lives. Every level is solvable, and one hundred percent fair.

5
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:29,325
Ice, locks and bombs bring new twists, across four seasons and thirteen scenes.

6
00:00:30,125 --> 00:00:36,619
Collect twenty car sets, claim free daily rewards, and unlock a bonus escape puzzle every ten levels.

7
00:00:37,419 --> 00:00:42,400
And with no WiFi needed, you can play anywhere: on your commute, or between meetings.

8
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:48,142
Park Pop is out now on Google Play. Clear the jam, and download it today!

